      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ $a=0$ 時變簡單",
      "body": [
        "$a=0$：$\\ln1=0$，$I(0)=0$　這就是 $a$ 放在這裡的理由",
        "$a\\in[\\alpha,\\beta]\\subset(-1,\\infty)$：$1+a\\sin^2x\\ge\\min(1,1+\\alpha)>0$，閉矩形上 $f,f_a$ 連續",
        "$a\\ne0$：分子湊成分母，",
        "輔助積分：上下除以 $\\cos^2x$，$t=\\tan x$：",
        "$\\frac{1}{1+a\\sin^2x}=\\frac{\\sec^2x}{\\sec^2x+a\\tan^2x}=\\frac{\\sec^2x}{1+(1+a)\\tan^2x}$，$dt=\\sec^2x\\,dx$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "I(a)=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\ln\\big(1+a\\sin^2x\\big)\\,dx\\quad(a>-1)",
        "I'(a)=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{\\sin^2x}{1+a\\sin^2x}\\,dx",
        "I'(a)=\\frac1a\\Big(\\frac\\pi2-J(a)\\Big),\\quad J(a)=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dx}{1+a\\sin^2x}",
        "J(a)=\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{dt}{1+(1+a)t^2}=\\frac{\\pi}{2\\sqrt{1+a}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 積回去要換元",
      "body": [
        "令 $s=\\sqrt{1+a}$（$a=s^2-1$）：",
        "$a=0$ 時公式給 $\\frac\\pi4=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^2x\\,dx$，跟直接代一致",
        "對 $a$ 積分，$da=2s\\,ds$：",
        "$I(0)=0$，$s=1$：$\\pi\\ln2+C=0$",
        "例：$a=1$ 得 $\\pi\\ln\\frac{1+\\sqrt2}2\\approx0.5913$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "I'(a)=\\frac{\\pi}{2a}\\Big(1-\\frac1s\\Big)=\\frac{\\pi(s-1)}{2(s^2-1)s}=\\frac{\\pi}{2s(s+1)}",
        "I=\\int\\frac{\\pi}{2s(s+1)}\\cdot2s\\,ds=\\pi\\ln(1+s)+C",
        "I(a)=\\pi\\ln\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+a}}2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 原積分又出現",
      "body": [
        "$[0,1]\\times[0,1]$ 上 $f,f_a$ 連續：",
        "部分分式（不可約二次式）：",
        "驗算：$-a(1+x^2)+(x+a)(1+ax)=x(1+a^2)$",
        "三個基本積分：",
        "• $\\int_0^1\\frac{a}{1+ax}dx=\\ln(1+a)$",
        "• $\\int_0^1\\frac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\frac12\\ln2$",
        "• $\\int_0^1\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\frac\\pi4$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{1+x^2}\\,dx,\\qquad I(a)=\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(1+ax)}{1+x^2}\\,dx",
        "I'(a)=\\int_0^1\\frac{x}{(1+ax)(1+x^2)}\\,dx",
        "\\frac{x}{(1+ax)(1+x^2)}=\\frac1{1+a^2}\\Big(\\frac{-a}{1+ax}+\\frac{x+a}{1+x^2}\\Big)",
        "I'(a)=\\frac{-\\ln(1+a)+\\frac12\\ln2+\\frac\\pi4a}{1+a^2}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 移項",
      "body": [
        "從 $0$ 積到 $1$：$I(1)=I(1)-I(0)=\\int_0^1I'(a)\\,da$",
        "$\\int_0^1\\frac{da}{1+a^2}=\\frac\\pi4$，$\\int_0^1\\frac{a\\,da}{1+a^2}=\\frac{\\ln2}2$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\begin{aligned}I(1)&=-I(1)+\\frac{\\ln2}2\\cdot\\frac\\pi4+\\frac\\pi4\\cdot\\frac{\\ln2}2\\\\2I(1)&=\\frac\\pi4\\ln2\\end{aligned}",
        "\\int_0^1\\frac{\\ln(1+x)}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\frac\\pi8\\ln2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "⑤ 一個會出事的例子",
      "body": [
