        "分離變數：$\\frac{dI}{I}=-2t\\,dt$，$\\ln I=-t^2+C$，$I(t)=I(0)e^{-t^2}$。$I(0)=\\int_0^{\\infty}e^{-x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\pi}}{2}$。",
