        "$I'(a)=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{\\sin^2 x}{1+a\\sin^2 x}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{a}\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{1+a\\sin^2 x}\\right)dx$（$a\\ne 0$）。",
        "輔助積分：上下同除以 $\\cos^2 x$、令 $u=\\tan x$，得 $\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\frac{dx}{1+a\\sin^2 x}=\\int_0^{\\infty}\\frac{du}{1+(1+a)u^2}=\\frac{\\pi}{2\\sqrt{1+a}}$。所以 $I'(a)=\\frac{\\pi}{2a}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+a}}\\right)$。",
        "積回去（$I(0)=0$）：$I(a)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\int_0^a\\frac{1}{s}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1+s}}\\right)ds$。令 $w=\\sqrt{1+s}$，$s=w^2-1$，$ds=2w\\,dw$：$\\frac{1}{s}\\left(1-\\frac{1}{w}\\right)\\cdot 2w=\\frac{2(w-1)}{w^2-1}=\\frac{2}{w+1}$。",
        "$I(a)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\cdot 2\\left[\\ln(w+1)\\right]_1^{\\sqrt{1+a}}=\\pi\\ln\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+a}}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\pi\\ln\\frac{1+\\sqrt{1+a}}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(ln(1+t*sin(x)^2), 0, pi/2) == pi*ln((1+sqrt(1+t))/2) ;; INT(1/(1+t*sin(x)^2), 0, pi/2) == pi/(2*sqrt(1+t))"
    },
