      "answer": "$\\frac{\\pi\\ln 2}{8}$",
      "claim": "INT(ln(1+x)/(1+x^2), 0, 1) == pi*ln(2)/8 ;; INT(x/((1+t*x)*(1+x^2)), 0, 1) == (ln(2)/2+t*pi/4-ln(1+t))/(1+t^2)"
    },
